## Interface: 16001
## Title: Obvi Guide: Zygor
## Notes: Hands the guides of your own installed Zygor addon to Obvi Guide in game, read from Zygor's folder (nothing is copied), so Zygor itself can stay disabled. Only the guides your Zygor licence covers. Not published: friends may use it, but it isn't promoted.
## Dependencies: ObviGuide
## OptionalDeps: ZygorGuidesViewerForever

ZygorParser.lua
ZygorStandIn.lua
ZygorFiles.xml
ZygorBridge.lua
